-token-comment)\">// ⚠ 也不报错，要到运行时才炸</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-token-constant)\">int</span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-token-keyword)\">?</span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-foreground)\"> maybe;                  </span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-token-comment)\">// sound null safety：可空性也在编译期追踪</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-token-comment)\">// print(maybe + 1);         // —— ⚠ 编译错误：可能为 null</span></span></code></pre>",
