e=\"color:var(--shiki-foreground)\">;               </span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-token-comment)\">// const：编译期常量</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-token-constant)\">int</span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-token-keyword)\">?</span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-foreground)\"> maybe;                </span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-token-comment)\">// 可空写进类型：int?</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-token-keyword)\">class</span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-token-constant)\"> Point</span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-foreground)\"> {              </span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-token-comment)\">// 字段必须写类型</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-token-keyword)\">  final</span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-token-constant)\"> double</span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-foreground)\"> x;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-token-keyword)\">  final</span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-token-constant)\"> double</span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-foreground)\"> y;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-token-constant)\">  Point</span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-foreground)\">(this.x, this.y);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-foreground)\">}</span></span></code></pre>",
